{
  "sn45.8:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 45.8 ",
  "sn45.8:0.2": "1. Avijjāvagga ",
  "sn45.8:0.3": "Vibhaṅgasutta ",
  "sn45.8:1.1": "Sāvatthinidānaṁ. ",
  "sn45.8:1.2": "“Ariyaṁ vo, bhikkhave, aṭṭhaṅgikaṁ maggaṁ desessāmi vibhajissāmi. ",
  "sn45.8:1.3": "Taṁ suṇātha, sādhukaṁ manasi karotha, bhāsissāmī”ti. ",
  "sn45.8:1.4": "“Evaṁ, bhante”ti kho te bhikkhū bhagavato paccassosuṁ. ",
  "sn45.8:1.5": "Bhagavā etadavoca: ",
  "sn45.8:2.1": "“Katamo ca, bhikkhave, ariyo aṭṭhaṅgiko maggo? ",
  "sn45.8:2.2": "Seyyathidaṁ—sammādiṭṭhi …pe… sammāsamādhi. ",
  "sn45.8:3.1": "Katamā ca, bhikkhave, sammādiṭṭhi? ",
  "sn45.8:3.2": "Yaṁ kho, bhikkhave, dukkhe ñāṇaṁ, dukkhasamudaye ñāṇaṁ, dukkhanirodhe ñāṇaṁ, dukkhanirodhagāminiyā paṭipadāya ñāṇaṁ—",
  "sn45.8:3.3": "ayaṁ vuccati, bhikkhave, sammādiṭṭhi. ",
  "sn45.8:4.1": "Katamo ca, bhikkhave, sammāsaṅkappo? ",
  "sn45.8:4.2": "Yo kho, bhikkhave, nekkhammasaṅkappo, abyāpādasaṅkappo, avihiṁsāsaṅkappo—",
  "sn45.8:4.3": "ayaṁ vuccati, bhikkhave, sammāsaṅkappo. ",
  "sn45.8:5.1": "Katamā ca, bhikkhave, sammāvācā? ",
  "sn45.8:5.2": "Yā kho, bhikkhave, musāvādā veramaṇī, pisuṇāya vācāya veramaṇī, pharusāya vācāya veramaṇī, samphappalāpā veramaṇī—",
  "sn45.8:5.3": "ayaṁ vuccati, bhikkhave, sammāvācā. ",
  "sn45.8:6.1": "Katamo ca, bhikkhave, sammākammanto? ",
  "sn45.8:6.2": "Yā kho, bhikkhave, pāṇātip